  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Education &amp; School Development in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">While most children in Ghana do attend school, the standard of education can be fairly low, and schools are often under-resourced and/or overcrowded. GVI Charitable Programs is partnered with nearly a dozen local schools in the community of Kokrobite to provide additional staff training resources, recruitment and onboarding of new teachers, necessary materials for learners (books, writing utensils, computers, stable internet access), and first-aid training to school staff.</narrative>
  </description>
